    "zh": "字典",
    "en": "Dictionaries"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "用键查找、登记和更新对应的值",
    "en": "Use keys to look up, add, and update values"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "用电池名字当键，电量当值。查出已有电池的电量，再登记新电池，最后给已登记的电池补电。",
    "en": "Use each battery’s name as a key and its charge as the value. Look up a charge, register a new battery, then update the charge for a battery that is already registered."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "按名字查电量",
        "en": "Look up a charge by name"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "名字是键，电量是值。在 records 里用键 B 查到 4 格。读出的 4 格可以先存起来，之后再用来计算。",
        "en": "The name is the key and the charge is the value. Looking up B in records gives 4 units. Save that reading for the calculation later."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "新名字增加一条记录",
        "en": "A new name adds a record"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "D 还没有登记。把电量 3 写到键 D 下，字典就有了 D 对应的记录。",
        "en": "D is new to the register. Write its charge of 3 under key D to add its record."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "同一个名字可以有新的值",
        "en": "An existing name can get a new value"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "B 原来有 4 格，补 3 格后是 7 格。把 7 存回键 B，B 对应的值变了，名字和记录条数都保持原样。",
        "en": "B starts at 4 and gains 3, bringing it to 7. Store 7 under the same key B. The name and the number of records stay the same."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "B 已经登记了 4 格。给它补 3 格后，哪句代码会更新 B 的记录？",
      "en": "B is already registered with 4 units. After adding 3, which line updates B’s record?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "records[\"B\"] = 7",
        "en": "records[\"B\"] = 7"
      },
      {
        "zh": "records[\"D\"] = 7",
        "en": "records[\"D\"] = 7"
      },
      {
        "zh": "records[\"B\"] = 3",
        "en": "records[\"B\"] = 3"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 0,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "还是用名字 B 当键，把补完后的总电量 7 存回这一条。",
      "en": "Use the same key B and store the total charge of 7 in that record."
    }
  },
